{{see|Бог}}
==Russian==

===Pronunciation===
/boχ/

===Noun===
'''бог''' (boχ) {{m}}, [[боги]] (bógi) {{p}}
:''Note: usually not capitalized in Russian in meaning of [[idol]], or one god in pagan religions (where god is one of many gods in pantheon), but capitalized in meaning of Christian God, Allakh and in other monotheistic religions.''

# [[God]]
# [[god]], [[idol]]
#:*{{RUchar|бог [[он|его́]] [[знать|зна́ет]]!}} — ''God only knows!; goodness knows!''
#:*{{RUchar|бо́же [[мой]]!}} — ''oh God!; good gracious!''
#:*{{RUchar|бог [[с#Russian|с]] [[он|ним]]!}} — ''Forget him!''
#:*{{RUchar|[[давать|дай]] бог!}} — ''God willing!; let’s hope so!''
#:*{{RUchar|[[ей-богу|ей-бо́гу]]!}} — ''really!; really and truly!''
#:*{{RUchar|[[ради|ра́ди]] бо́га!}} — ''for God’s sake!''
#:*{{RUchar|[[сохранять|сохрани́]] бо́же!}} — ''God forbid!''
#:*{{RUchar|[[слава богу|сла́ва бо́гу]]!}} — ''thank God!''

